.SH NAME
voltkit\-smart\-paste \- Paste the clipboard converted: tidy JSON, a table as Markdown, a cleaned link…
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBvoltkit smart\-paste\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Paste the clipboard converted: tidy JSON, a table as Markdown, a cleaned link…
.PP
Opens a small window listing the conversions that fit what\*(Aqs on the clipboard, with a preview of each. Enter pastes the chosen one into the app that had focus and restores the clipboard. An image on the clipboard can be pasted as its text (OCR).
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
